D731  F5                                PUSH AF
D732  CB 1C                     S16R3:  RR H
D734  CB 1D                             RR L
D736  15                                DEC D
D737  20 F9                             JR NZ,S16R3
D739  C3 30 E6                          JP ROT16B
D73C  00 00 00 00                       DS SHPG+64-$
