D741  15                                DEC D
D742  20 FC                             JR NZ,S16R4
D744  C3 54 E6                          JP SHL16F
D747  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00           DS SHPG+80-$
D747  00                        
D750  CB 3C                     S16R5:  SRL H                   ; 5 SHR
D752  CB 1D                             RR L
D754  15                                DEC D
D755  20 F9                             JR NZ,S16R5
D757  C3 63 E6                          JP SHR16F
