D790  CB 0D                     S8R1:   RRC L                   ; 1 ROR
D792  15                                DEC D
D793  20 FB                             JR NZ,S8R1
D795  C3 A5 E6                          JP ROT8B
D798  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00           DS SHPG+160-$
D7A0  F1                                POP AF                  ; 2 RCL
