D7C2  15                                DEC D
D7C3  20 FB                             JR NZ,S8R4
D7C5  C3 C1 E6                          JP SHL8F
D7C8  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00           DS SHPG+208-$
D7D0  CB 3D                     S8R5:   SRL L                   ; 5 SHR
D7D2  15                                DEC D
